window.products.push({"id":975181,"name":"Rosanna Marie Antoinette Set of 4 Dessert Plates, Gift-boxed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cedxl4GIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description King Louis XVI¿s queen loved nothing more than a grand musical, performed in the privacy of her palace. You can orchestrate a splendid setting with these fashion plates, illustrated with Marie Antoinette and the names of her homes: the Tuileries, Versailles, Hotel de Ville and Le Petit Trianon. This collection is made of refined porcelain; it is microwave and dishwasher safe. Amazon.com A recent star-studded film and a television documentary have sparked a resurgence of interest in France's most flamboyant queen. Marie Antoinette is depicted in a different fashionable outfit on each of these four plates named in her honor, which are also inscribed with the names of four of her residences: Versailles, the Tuileries, Le Petit Trianon, and the Hotel de Ville. Made of refined porcelain in a squared, scalloped shape, the eight-inch plates are ideal for serving cake--of course--or a side salad. Rosanna's same-shaped Dinner Party dinner plates in chocolate brown especially complement these smaller plates. Perhaps because cake is the operative word for Marie Antoinette, the dessert plates are the only member of the tableware collection. Packaged in a drawer-style gift box in a matching design, the plates are safe to use for warming food in the microwave and clean up with aristocratic ease in the dishwasher. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cedxl4GIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosanna","source_asin":"B000TKCQYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TKCQYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TKCQYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
