window.products.push({"id":975394,"name":"Santa Claus Fridge Magnet Refrigerator-Stickers, Christmas Decorations-Window Scratch-Free Set of 18 Parts and 8 Stickers, CERLMLAND","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vxPHpW32L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Christmas Gift For Children throughout the Christmas season.Santa's magnet refrigerator stickers can decorate the Christmas kitchen and make the whole kitchen full of Christmas festival atmosphere.Christmas theme stickers can add DIY to each glass window, fridge, metal surface and room door. DIY Your Santa Claus，Santa's magnet refrigerator sticker consists of 18 parts and 8 Christmas theme stickers , which can be decorated by family members to increase family fun. You can make the most of your imagination and make a Santa Claus of different shapes. Recycling - lovely Santa's refrigerator magnet set not only can be used for Christmas decoration, but also can be used to place menu,Cooking methods，plans, tips, notes, instructions or family photos on the iron surface. Scratch-Free：Strong refrigerator magnet, durable, can be used repeatedly.It will not slide easily.Christmas stickers can be fun to decorate every corner of Christmas. Interesting and lovely Santa Claus design, return to the nature of the strong atmosphere of Christmas.8 electrostatic stickers can be used to decorate the whole Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vxPHpW32L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CERLMLAND","source_asin":"B08GKJSTYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GKJSTYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GKJSTYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":975395,"name":"Barefoot Dreams The CozyChic Disney Winnie The Pooh Blanket, Multicolor Throw, Double Layer Jacquard Knit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tXNFqZQ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For any fan of the Disney classic character Winnie the Pooh, this CozyChic blanket by Barefoot Dreams is a great way to display your love of this cuddly cartoon bear. Imagination has never been cozier! This blanket is made of a super soft polyester yarn in a double-layered jacquard knit design. This plush knit design gives the blanket a soft, vintage feel. Contributing to the vintage vibe is its multicolored display. The blanket features a whimsical illustration style image of Winnie the Pooh and Piglet. The lovable cartoon bear is holding hands with his good friend Piglet. Together, they’re walking towards a red balloon floating by some trees. Another cute element of this blanket is a small canvas label sewn into the bottom right corner. It cheerfully reads, “How do you spell love? – Piglet You don’t spell it, you feel it. – Pooh.” This precious quote from Winnie the Pooh helps to tie the entire aesthetic of the blanket together. These blankets come in small, medium, and large sizes. This large blanket measures 54” x 72”. The blanket is easy to care for and wash. The 100% polyester fabric should be machine washed in cold water with mild detergent on a gentle cycle. Do not use bleach or fabric softener. If necessary, tumble dry on Air Fluff or the lowest dryer setting, with no dryer sheets. We do not recommend the use of fabric softeners, as they can alter the look and feel of the fabric. These blankets make excellent gifts for boys and girls, men and women, regardless of age. From babies and young children to full-grown adults, Winnie the Pooh lovers everywhere will be delighted with these soft, cuddly blankets!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tXNFqZQ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barefoot Dreams","source_asin":"B07LB6VWMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LB6VWMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LB6VWMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
