window.products.push({"id":975399,"name":"Luxxetta Office Computer Desk – 55” x 23” White Laminated Wooden Particleboard Table and Gray Powder Coated Steel Frame - Work or Home – Easy Assembly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vrC9R3rEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your computer set up with Luxxetta's super modern and stable Series CD140 Computer Desk! A perfect fit for any room! You spend hours on your desk working, writing, reading, and doing all sorts of things so you might as well get a desk that not only fits everything you need, but looks and feels great. Perfect for any setting, let Luxxetta improve the quality of your work or home environment with the a brand new strong and stylish computer desk. PRODUCT FEATURES - Dimensions: 55\" Wide x 23.6\" Deep x 29.5” High- Weight Capacity: 900 lbs.- Laminated Particle Board + Stainless Steel- Assembly Tools and Instructions Included- Great Simple and Modern Design for Home and Office THE PERFECT WORKSTATION Get your daily tasks done or play an online game - whatever you need, our desks come through with everything you need to make your workstation one that you can live in forever. With a 61 inch long table, you are provided with a lot more space than you're used to. Place your laptop, books, music players, video games consoles, toys, collectibles, fancy displays, anything on top! Great for college students to study in complete luxury and personalize to fit their style. PREMIUM QUALITY Everything from the look and feel of the desk is made to impress. Laminated particle board and powder coated steel make for a power combination that is sure to provide excellent stability and sturdiness. It's able to withstand up to 900 pounds so you have more than enough room to play with. Assemble it easily by following the provided instruction and using the tools packaged. You will find that our computer desk feels like nothing else! With Luxxetta you're getting nothing but the best and strongest computer desks out there with great durability, incredible strength, and great usability. Get yours today and enhance the look and feel of your home and office!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vrC9R3rEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxxetta","source_asin":"B078JRZJZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078JRZJZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078JRZJZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
