window.products.push({"id":975403,"name":"Boho Cotton Area Rug 3'x5' Woven Moroccan Geometric Black Rugs Chic Bohemian Indoor Outdoor Rug Farmhouse Throw Rug Washable Floor Carpet for Entry Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MMOHzGbgS._AC_SL1167_.jpg","description":"When it comes to home decor, there’s nothing quite like a unique bohemian rug to make a bold statement. Or a more subtle one, if you prefer the boho kitchen rug isone of the best ways to bring a bedroom, living room, or even dining room space together and make your interior design shine.If you’re intrigued by the ideaof adding a touch of boho to your home,a moroccan rug is a great way to add color and style to a room. Yarn-dyed Process Style Your Room:This collection includes contemporary Yarn-dyed designs & trendy boho themes for in- & even outdoor use. White woven rug with blackyarn geometric pattern.Black woven rug with white yarn geometric pattern.small plush yarn tufted woven on the entryway rug adds exquisite detail and craftsmanship.High-quality workmanship, the fabric is thick, durably designed for long-lasting life. Don’t worry, the yarn tufts are hand-woven and won’t fall off at will. Theindoor outdoor patio rug will not deform and fade easily PRODUCTS DESCRIPTION Fabric：45% cotton +45% polyester +10% viscose pets and kids Friendly, Technics：Hand Knotted, Handmade, Woven Size：2'x3', 2'x4.3',2.3'x5.3',3'x5', 4'x6',5x7ft Usage:kitchen,guest bathroom,guest bedroom,front door entryway,fireplace,sink,hallway, under counter stools,in front of the tub,entrance,living room,laundry,patio,dining room,entrance,porch.. Washing instruction: Machine wash the small farmhouse rug in a mesh bag with gentle water,do not bleach.Lay flat to dry. Hand wash can extend usage time Tips 1:Size excludes the tassel: 2'x3', 2'x4.3',2.3'x5.3' feet.Each side tassel is about 3.1 - 3.9 inches Size not exclude the tassel:3'x5', 4'x6',5x7feet. TIP 2:The back of the black and white bathroom rug without non-slip bottom,highly recommend match with slip grip for the bottom Tips 3:you can sit on your front porch under a welcome mat for a layered effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MMOHzGbgS._AC_SL1167_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uyi Grip","source_asin":"B092MRTLLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092MRTLLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092MRTLLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
