window.products.push({"id":975413,"name":"KOXIN-KARLU Melamine Bowls, 7.5-inch Pasta Bowls Salad Bowl, set of 6 in 6 Assorted Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ard2D0v+L._AC_SL1368_.jpg","description":"Easy to Use - The bowl's diameter is 7.5-inch and 2.4-inch deep. The design of the bowl makes it easy to hold and food won't spill out. 32-ounce of maximum capacity is perfect for cereal, salads, soup, and pho. (comfort capacity is 26-28 ounce) Durable and Shatter proof - The bowl is made of 100% melamine. It won't be shatter like glass and porcelain. It is also perfectly stackable. Easy to Clean - The set of bowls have a gloss finish which makes it easier to clean and less likely to stain. It is also chip resistant and always maintains a shine. Reusable ultra-durable bowls for everyday use, for indoor and outdoor dining. great for patio, picnic, and other outdoor meals. Use and Care - Top rack dishwasher safe , Not microwave safe. If there is any quality problem of our flatware set, welcome to contact us, we full refund or replacement for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ard2D0v+L._AC_SL1368_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOXIN-KARLU","source_asin":"B0BXKFYQ91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXKFYQ91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXKFYQ91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":975414,"name":"COZYART Twin Size Faux Fur Throw Blanket for Bed - 60\"x80\" Hot Pink Super Soft Plush Luxurious and Elegant with Comfy Reversible Microfiber Fluffy Lar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fN7vz13OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADED TECHNOLOGY: Compared with other sofa throw blankets that have shedding problems, our unique technology makes our blankets almost no shedding (there will be some floating hairs during the production process, not falling off from the blanket). Thereby improving the use experience and prolonging its service life. If you are tired of blankets falling off, COZYART Throw Blanket will be the ideal choice for you. PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: COZYART blankets are made of 100% high-quality polyester microfiber. These fluffy blankets are extremely soft, and breathable. The front is made from high-grade 350 GSM faux rabbit fur to provide the luxurious feel of real fur, and the Reverse is made from Polyester for optimal coziness and warmth when in use. OVERSIZED THROW BLANKET: 60\"x 80\". The COZYART fuzzy blankets come in a variety of tones. They will be perfect for a throw blanket for bedding, and a decorative throw for a couch. Drape this hot pink throw blanket over a couch, bed, or chair to add an elegant look to your living room or bedroom. Whether you want to soften your home with a plush throw blanket or want a cozy blanket to snuggle up with on those chilly days and nights, this throw is you need. PERFECT GIFT: Express your love and appreciation by sending a comfortable gift to family and friends. It fits any age and will keep them warm and comfortable. Whether you are shopping for a wedding, housewarming, Christmas, birthday, or any other occasion, this cozy blanket is a perfect gift. Think of this as wrapping your loved ones in this super soft blanket and putting your loved ones in a nice, cozy place, like a fantastic dream. Cleaning instructions & Customer Service - The COZYART faux fur blanket of unique craft allows it to wash in the washing machine. when washing this fuzzy throw blanket, machine washes with cold water and gentle detergent, separately, do not bleach or iron, then air dry. We value your feedback and want to hear from you. If you have any questions about your order, please contact us, and we will solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fN7vz13OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZYART","source_asin":"B0BJTM7Q49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJTM7Q49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJTM7Q49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
