window.products.push({"id":975423,"name":"Emile Henry Couleurs 12-Inch Pie Plate with Tea Towel, Cobalt Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZNAJVF5ZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Marcigny, a small town nestling between the hills of Southern Burgundy, has been home to Emile Henry for the past 150 years. Faithful to its origins, the entire production is carried out here. Thanks to its clay, rich in refractory properties, Burgundy has remained a fertile area for potters, passing on their savoir-faire from generation to generation. Clay, a natural and noble material, has been used since the mists of the time to cook or preserve food. While respecting the traditional techniques, Emile Henry has introduced technological improvements (Ceradon ®) so that the dishes are more resistant to mechanical and thermal shock. Strong, durable, all Emile Henry pieces can be taken directly from the freezer to the hot oven, can go under a broiler and is microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. The natural clay is unsurpassed for conducting and retaining heat. All pieces are perfect for everyday use and carry a 3 year warranty against defects. Amazon.com This extra-large pie plate measures 12 inches in diameter by 2 inches deep. It's great for savory casseroles, dessert pies, or custard desserts such as the classic Provencal clafoutis. Ultra-durable when exposed to temperatures ranging from zero to 500 degrees F, this pie plate can go straight from the freezer into a hot oven, and it's safe for use under a broiler or in a microwave. Emile Henry bakeware is chip-resistant, sturdy, and lovely. Among cooks and bakers, it is much coveted not only for its baking performance, but also for its beauty. The beauty of Emile Henry's design is its simplicity; the pie plate is solid-colored with simple fluting around the border. But the high-gloss glaze and clean, primary Couleurs colors--pieces are available in Blanc White, Bouton d'Or Saffron, Primevère Green, Pivoine Red, and Pervenche or Cobalt Blues--are anything but plain. The Couleurs 12-inch pie plate comes with a 100 percent cotton tea towel, white with a colored border embroidered with crockery, herbs, fruits and vegetables and emblazoned with the Emile Henry logo; the towel measures 20-1/2 by 28-1/2 inches. Matching baking dishes in the Couleurs style include a lasagna pan, smaller pie plates, custard ramekins, and a large lidded casserole. Emile Henry offers a three-year warranty against defects. Over 150 years of experience have made the potters at Emile Henry expert at producing bakeware that is as lovely as it is useful. Ever since 1850, Emile Henry has been producing ceramics in the Burgundy region of France from a clay of superior quality that holds up amazingly well to a wide range of temperatures. In addition, the company has developed patented technological improvements to increase the durability and strength of its tableware and bakeware. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZNAJVF5ZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B00028K5W8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00028K5W8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00028K5W8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
