window.products.push({"id":975497,"name":"Dyson AM03 Pedestal Fan, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cD8OkHM-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The AM03 has an adjustable height from 46 inches to 55 inches Dyson AM03 Air Multiplier Pedestal Fan Conventional fans have blades which chop the air before it hits you, causing unpleasant buffeting. AM03 doesn’t have blades. Instead, it uses Air Multiplier technology to amplify the air drawn in at its base by up to 18 times, generating an uninterrupted stream of smooth air. No blades. No buffeting. It’s suitable for use in larger areas, such as offices or to cool whole rooms. With no fast spinning blades, AM03 is safe to use. It’s easy to clean too. And because it makes you feel cooler, you can turn down your air conditioning. This could save you up to 20% on your energy bills.* AM03 is available in Silver/Silver Patented Dyson Technology Dyson engineers are constantly testing and inventing, trying to find new ways to make their technology work better. As they work, they file patent applications to protect their inventions. That’s why the only place you’ll find Dyson technology is inside a Dyson machine. Dyson fans use Air Multiplier technology to amplify surrounding air. How AM03 works: Up to 8.71 gallons of air are drawn in per second by an energy efficient brushless motor. A combination of the technologies used in turbochargers and jet engines generates a powerful flow of air. Up to 8.71 gallons of air are drawn in per second by an energy efficient brushless motor. A combination of the technologies used in turbochargers and jet engines generates a powerful flow of air. Airflow is accelerated through an annular aperture. It passes over a 7-degree airfoil-shaped ramp, which channels its direction. Airflow is accelerated through an annular aperture. It passes over a 7-degree airfoil-shaped ramp, which channels its direction. Air behind the Dyson Air Multiplier fan is drawn into the airflow, through a process known as inducement. Air behind the Dyson Air Multiplier fan is drawn into the airflow, through a process known as inducement. Air around the machine is also drawn into the airflow, through a process known as entrainment, amplifying it by up to 18 times. The resulting airflow is smooth and constant, with no unpleasant buffeting. Air around the machine is also drawn into the airflow, through a process known as entrainment, amplifying it by up to 18 times. The resulting airflow is smooth and constant, with no unpleasant buffeting. AM03 Pedestal Fan Product Features: Smooth airflow The blades on conventional fans cause unpleasant buffeting because they chop the air. Air Multiplier technology creates an uninterrupted stream of smooth air. Smooth air from the AM03 Pedestal fan No fast spinning blades Because there are no fast spinning blades, AM03 is safe to use around children. And with no blades or grilles it’s easy to clean too. With no blades, AM03 is safe and easy to clean Dimmer-switch control The airflow generated by the Dyson Air Multiplier fan can be adjusted at the turn of a dial to precisely deliver the amount of air that you want. Dimmer switch control allows for precise adjustment Smooth Oscillation & a Remote Control The AM03 fan oscillates 90 degrees at the touch of a button. Airflow and oscillation can be controlled using the remote control, which stores magnetically on top of the machine when not in use. The remote control can be used to control airflow level and oscillation Easy to adjust Simple to adjust height and tilt. No clamping required. AM03 has adjustable height and tilt 2-year parts and labor warranty All Dyson machines undergo a lengthy and rigorous testing program. That’s why Dyson Air Multiplier fans include a 2-year warranty covering parts and labor. What’s in the box: 1 x Fan base unit 1 x Loop amplifier 1 x Stand 1 x Remote control 1 x Base plate 1 x Operating manual  *Assumes up to 6% savings in air conditioning costs for every degree Fahrenheit that thermostat is raised. (See U.S. EPA and D.O.E. Energy Savings Calculator). Also assumes elevated air speed may offset increase in air temperature by up to five degrees (See ASHRAE Standard 55-2004-Thermal Environment Conditions for Human Occupancy). Air Multiplier must be used in conjunction with and in close proximity to air conditioning ventilation output in each room to recognize savings benefit. Actual savings may vary based on use and other factors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cD8OkHM-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyson","source_asin":"B003TFDV0Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003TFDV0Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003TFDV0Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
