window.products.push({"id":975585,"name":"40+ Dried Eucalyptus Stems Real for Shower, 15-25 PCS 17'' 8OZ Preserved Fresh Eucalyptus Plant Live Green Leaves, Dry Eucalyptus Branches Greenery Bu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w5onP2uCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿Natural Plant: Made from 100% naturally dried teadrop eucalyptus leaves, each pack is about 8-9 OZ, the length is 14 \"-17\". There are about 14-25 branches with 40+ small stems, someone has many stems and some have none, which are not fixed and we can't precisely count them by the number of stems. Every leaf of a natural plant varies in size, spots, scratches, and other natural growth marks on leaves are common phenomena. 🌿Permanent Preservation: Using special preservation technology from Japan, we can retain the natural plants’ color and flexibility of eucalyptus stems Even, protect them from becoming dry and withered. The products can be preserved for a long time without sunlight, moisture and fertilizer, which are more vigorous than fake artificial plant. 🌿Home SPA: The original smell of eucalyptus is retained without any additives.The steam of the shower releases the essential oils of the eucalyptus, relax your mind. To increase relaxation in the shower, try adding some sprigs of eucalyptus and indulging in its aromatherapy properties. Smells tend to diminish over time. 🌿Year-round Decoration: Eucalyptus leaves are ideal decorations for homes, gardens, offices, farmhouses, photo backgrounds, wedding decorations, especially wedding bouquets, corsages, wedding greenery, table decorations or elegant vase displays. Similar to olive branches and boxwood greenery stems, they can also be used to make natural-style flower arrangements to add to the festive atmosphere. 🌿Perfect Supporting Role: Eucalyptus stems can be paired with all flowers to make a beautiful bouquet, which is totally fit for any DIY project and the perfect gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w5onP2uCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saipro","source_asin":"B0B492BPKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B492BPKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B492BPKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
