window.products.push({"id":975603,"name":"EBUNG Adults Weighted Blanket for Sleeping(15 lbs, 48x72, Twin Size)Heavy Blanket 100% Cotton and Glass Beads. Calms and Relaxes –Uniform Pressure Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h3BKOs94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton SLEEP BETTER & LIVE HEALTHY — Backed by innovative deep pressure stimulation, EBUNG weighted blanket offers you a big bear hug, calms your stressed nerves, prevents agitated rolling around, relaxes your mind, and helps keep serotonin/melatonin levels at an optimum level for a restful night’s sleep! COMFORTABLE & COZY — Breathable sensory blanket is ultra-soft to touch, comes in optimal weight for every body type, feels gentle on your delicate skin, and allows for enough air circulation — SPECIAL weighted blanket therapy that keeps you warm during chilly winters & cool during hot summers! UNIFORM PRESSURE DISTRIBUTION — Sleeping blanket features a unique layered design with glass beads stitched into multiple individual pockets that inhibit any movement/noise, conforms to your body shape, and dispenses pressure uniformly that simulates a lovely cuddle. HIGH-QUALITY HEAVY BLANKET — Made with the finest quality cotton and premium glass beads, our weighted blankets for adults come in a perfect 72 Inches x 48 Inches SIZE features tough industrial level stitching that will not easily unravel and result in any leakage of beads — LONG LASTING weighted comforter. MULTIPLE OPTIONS — Engineered to be ‘10% of your body weight plus one’, our compression blanket is available in a wide range of sizes & weights for you to choose the PERFECT therapeutic blanket for your body!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h3BKOs94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ebung","source_asin":"B07NSNJXR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NSNJXR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NSNJXR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":975604,"name":"NORSE EMPIRE 12 oz Wooden Celtic Knot Cup with Hand Pyrography Woodburning - Viking-Style Drinking Vessel | Viking wood style Beer mug | Wooden Gift A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717rovHsTgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍻 EXQUISITE WOODBURNING - This one-of-a-kind 6 oz. the wooden cup has been meticulously engraved using the age-old pyrography technique, which involves carefully applying a heated element to the surface of the wood to burn the design into it. Hand-made vintage cup with natural wood. No BPA & toxic! No odor! 🍻 AN EXPERIENCE WITH VIKING BEER - Celtic knots are a variety of knots and stylized graphical representations of knots used for decoration used extensively in the Celtic style of Insular art. These knots are most known for their adaptation in the ornamentation of Christian monuments and manuscripts, such as the 8th-century St. Teilo Gospels, the Book of Kells, and the Lindisfarne Gospels. Give yourself a taste of a real Viking journey. 🍻 Best Gift: This Viking Cup is the ideal gift for medieval enthusiasts or your rustic outdoorsman (or woman). This is no ordinary Gift. A gift for all wood lovers, fans, Renaissance fashion, medieval mug collectors, outdoor travel mugs, housewarming, and the perfect gift for the groom or best man. 🍻 Handle Easy: Incredibly lightweight, which makes it steadier. Our wooden tankard handles hot liquids well and is easy to clean. Capacity: 12 oz, 6 inches Height, 3 inches Diameter. Made from strictly natural materials including its 100% non-toxic coating and safe for food/liquids used. 🍻 HANDCRAFTED WITH CARE - The attention to detail that goes into the construction is the secret ingredient of beautifully crafted woodwork. For generations, our artisans have been creating mugs. Each of our vintage wine glasses is hand-cut from a single piece of mango wood, hand-engraved (using a pyrography pen), and hand-polished to nearly perfection. 🍻 Easy to maintain and clean: Simply wash with warm water and air dry, do not use strong washing liquid, Do not store wooden glass near the heating devices or leave them in the sun, the wood dries up and later cracks may appear, keeping wooden cup is in the locker or any other dry place. Do not leave the wooden glass in a container with water for a long time, wipe them dry with a towel after each time you wash them. 🍻 100% Customer Satisfaction Guarantee: If you have any problem with our mug after received, just contact us! We offer a 100% money-back guarantee. Your product comes guaranteed by our one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717rovHsTgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORSE EMPIRE","source_asin":"B0B9Q3YZ79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9Q3YZ79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9Q3YZ79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
