window.products.push({"id":975955,"name":"Deco 79 Bohemian Teak Wood Horse Sculpture, 25\" x 10\" x 23\", Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hiS8jMgOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adorn your surface space by incorporating sculpture into your decor to add depth and texture in your home. An artistic display to showcase your personality and enhance the look of any open table top space. This natural, earthy wood decor makes a great addition to spaces that need more grounding and nature; also makes a wonderful gift. This item ships in 1 carton. Please note that this item is for decorative use only. Teak sculpture makes a great gift for any occasion. The one-of-a-kind item you have purchased is made from the stumps and unused trunks of harvested teak trees. This teak comes from ecologically managed forests. Once the tree is harvested, the remaining stumps must be removed to make space to plant replacement trees. In the past, these pieces would be harvested and then burned to dispose of them, which created pollution. Today we use these tree stumps and trunks to create beautiful, handcrafted pieces for your home. Coloring, cracks, and shapes will vary between items. Each one is unique and the artisan works to bring out the inner beauty within the tree to become a cherished piece of art for your home. Suitable for indoor use only. This item ships fully assembled in one piece. Due to the live edges of the piece, each is unique, so no two products will have an identical pattern, shade, or cut. Made in Indonesia. This is a single brown colored statue. Bohemian style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hiS8jMgOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B094T6788W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-975955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094T6788W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094T6788W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
