window.products.push({"id":976000,"name":"Banana Hanger Holder Organizer with Durable Wood Base Sturdy Metal Hook for Home Kitchen Countertop Useful Simple Charming Design Tree Stand Hanging F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VXz5-SFYL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"High Quality and Durable Banana Hook - Height 12.4 inch. Base Diameter:5.9 inch Weight:367 g. Sturdy Metal and Hook: This is a solid, nicely finished banana stand. This hanger and base are made of high-quality metal. The hook is generous in size and perfect in shape to hold a bunch! Easy to install, quick, and easy to put together. You’ll have this banana tree hanger on your kitchen countertop in no time. Steel Sturdy Base & EVA Non-slip Mat - The base is made of quality steel, which is strong and hard. We use the transparent coating of environmental protection. Effectively prevent molding. It also has a high load-bearing capacity. It is stable and the stand is well-balanced. We have fitted the base with a large stickable non-slip mat. A non-slip design can keep the banana hanger base from slipping. Keep all your countertops and furniture from damage! Space Saving Banana Hangers - Don’t worry about your bananas, this hanger can help you organize your bananas. A banana holder can extend that time between a banana ripening and going bad. You can hang some bananas on the hook. You can easy to take a banana when you want to eat. You will like its design. You can easy to set up it in your kitchen or dining table. You can also use this banana tree hanger ban and coffee mugs, headphones, towels, and other lightweight items. Benefits of Banana Stands - Banana hangers work by allowing air to circulate around the bananas, dissipating the ethylene gas produced by ripening bananas, which speeds the ripening process. Hanging bananas makes them last longer. A banana hanger is necessary for anyone who enjoys bananas in order to keep them fresh longer. If you can prolong the period between when bananas ripen and when they start spoiling, you’ll maximize the time to enjoy your favorite fruit. Multiple Usages & 100% Service - It can be used for towels, key holders, pan pot holders, coffee mugs, and other lightweight items. Perfect for family or friends as a nice gift. The satisfaction of our customers is our greatest aim. If you have any issues with your holder, please tell us without hesitation, we will try our best to resolve your problem. We promise a 100% satisfaction guarantee by full refund or replacement!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VXz5-SFYL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MTKITDER","source_asin":"B09Z31KBXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z31KBXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z31KBXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
